{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/incidencematrixmodule\/orientedincidencematrix\/reversed"]}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"remoteSource":{"fileName":"OrientedIncidenceMatrix.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Grafluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/IncidenceMatrixModule\/OrientedIncidenceMatrix.swift#L420"},"symbolKind":"property","extendedModule":"IncidenceMatrixModule","roleHeading":"Instance Property","externalID":"s:21IncidenceMatrixModule08OrientedaB0V8reversedACvp","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"reversed","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OrientedIncidenceMatrix","preciseIdentifier":"s:21IncidenceMatrixModule08OrientedaB0V","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"title":"reversed","role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"IncidenceMatrixModule"}]},"sections":[],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/IncidenceMatrixModule\/documentation\/IncidenceMatrixModule\/OrientedIncidenceMatrix\/reversed"},"abstract":[{"text":"Every column’s sources and targets swapped, every entry negated (a vertex on both sides","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"stays 0): Gallo et al.’s symmetric image. An involution. O(1): the planes swap.","type":"text"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IncidenceMatrixModule\/documentation\/IncidenceMatrixModule","doc:\/\/IncidenceMatrixModule\/documentation\/IncidenceMatrixModule\/OrientedIncidenceMatrix"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"reversed"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:21IncidenceMatrixModule08OrientedaB0V","text":"OrientedIncidenceMatrix","identifier":"doc:\/\/IncidenceMatrixModule\/documentation\/IncidenceMatrixModule\/OrientedIncidenceMatrix"